As I mentioned, um, we, we heard a lot of desire to see a little more on the ground floor plan.

199
00:16:25,581 --> 00:16:33,206
So I think we, we spent a lot of time as a team, both, both cube three and Jacobs kind of understanding and wrapping our heads around the spaces and how they may lay out.

