270
00:24:50,346 --> 00:24:56,789
Embodied carbon is what it takes to make the building, the materials in the building, get it to the site and everything about putting the building together.

271
00:24:56,809 --> 00:25:02,012
And then there's the operational carbon of how healthy is the building long-term and how is it operating?

