00:25:05,413 --> 00:25:08,055
So the first thing that we all talk about is operational carbon.

274
00:25:09,492 --> 00:25:17,936
thing out there is, you know, no fossil fuel burning, fossil fuel reduction, which is obviously incredibly important, but we need to do it in a very measured way.

