00:25:18,777 --> 00:25:25,520
So what we do, if you can see this graph, blue operational carbon and orange is embodied carbon.

276
00:25:26,761 --> 00:25:29,703
A year ago, we were all designing buildings in the left column.

277
00:25:30,103 --> 00:25:37,587
We had mixed fuel, both electrical and burning natural gas in order to achieve the mechanical systems and tempering of space.

278
00:25:39,040 --> 00:25:48,785
Today we are a little bit beyond the next line, which is starting to design energy efficient mixed fuel systems.

279
00:25:50,827 --> 00:26:00,772
The world, the neighboring municipalities, Boston, the greater Boston area is really starting to look at, well, what if we do all electric buildings?

