00:26:06,617 --> 00:26:08,438
There's a reason labs haven't gone that way yet.

282
00:26:08,678 --> 00:26:10,378
There's a huge process load in labs.

283
00:26:10,939 --> 00:26:14,840
And in order to go all electric, one, the grid needs to be able to handle it.

284
00:26:14,960 --> 00:26:15,200
