00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:30,346
Let's just assume that it can, uh, in order to get all the way down to, uh, Taking all extracting all the heat from the cold in the winter here in, in New England, without using any fossil fuels for, for added heat.

286
00:26:31,265 --> 00:26:32,686
The technology isn't quite there yet.

287
00:26:32,986 --> 00:26:38,350
We can get 90, 95% of the way there with what we have today, but not quite there.

